{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="1">... What is all this?"</STYLE><PG>
"First we have to fill our stomachs, or we'll never survive hours of back-to-back movies! I've got a proper plan worked out, after all!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But I left my wallet behind. My phone too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Come to think of it, I'd left my wallet and phone behind too...</STYLE><PG>
"Today, to thank you for everything, I'm treating you Senpais, sir!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uh-huh... thanks..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
